<title>NORWAY: Saga says board approves Santa Fe deal.</title>
<headline>Saga says board approves Santa Fe deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian oil company Saga Petroleum ASA said on Tuesday its supervisory board had approved the acquisition of North Sea exploration group Santa Fe Exploration Ltd.</p>
</text>
